  <p class="eyebrow">Format</p>
  <h3>Alternate days. Live, online and offline.</h3>
  <div class="lines">
    <p>After the two free sessions, live sessions run on alternate days, two hours each, with your mentor present. Goal-oriented, so there's no fixed session count or end date.</p>
    <p>Online, or in person in Bhiwani and Hisar. Just a laptop and internet.</p>
    <p>On the days in between you learn on your own and build. You build agents again and again &mdash; repetition is the method. Every day is a project with a log entry: hypothesis, actions, expectations.</p>
    <p>Never a recording. The room is the product.</p>
  </div>
</div>

